{"content": "You use <span class=\"strong\">which </span> to ask questions about a person or thing in a group.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "In the present, the form is", "type": "text"}, {"content": " <center>which + noun + am/is/are/do/does + rest of sentence or person/thing + verb ?</center>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Example:<br><span class=\"italic\">Which bus is in front of the restaurant?</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">How</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "You use <span class=\"strong\">how</span> to ask \u201cin what way\u201d", "type": "text"}, {"content": "In the present, the form is", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<center>how or how + expressions + am/is/are/do/does + rest of sentence or person/thing + verb ?</center>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Example:<br><span class=\"italic\">How much does it cost?</span>", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "cage ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a box made of wire or metal bars in which people keep animals or birds ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Butterflies are not kept in cages!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le03ob04aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": "These are words you hear on a guided tour.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "enclosure ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "an area surrounded by a wall, fence or netting", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The butterfly farm has many enclosures.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le03ob04aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "species", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a group of animals or plants that are similar", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: There are many different species of animals at the zoo.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le03ob04aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "rainforest ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a tropical forest that receives a lot of rain and has very tall trees", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: It always rains in the Costa Rican rainforest!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le03ob04aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "cloud", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a white or gray mass in the sky that is made of many very small drops of water", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: There are many clouds in the sky today.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le03ob04aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "downpour ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a sudden, heavy rain  ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I hope there isn't a downpour. I forgot my umbrella.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le03ob04aud06", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "plantation", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a large area of land where you grow crops", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: We visited a coffee plantation.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le03ob04aud07", "type": "audio"}]}, {"content": "engenn4le03ob04re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "Research a coffee plantation tour in your area or in another country.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write five Wh-questions you would ask. Example: <span class=\"italic\">How much is the entry fee?</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Practice your questions aloud using falling intonation.", "type": "text"}, {"content": " Share your questions with a partner.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"content": "I identify guided tours.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I ask various questions to get information.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I write complete questions that ask for information.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I practice asking questions using falling intonation.", "type": "text"}]}]}